2653 hops and, more importantly, the single required relay never fires in time.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_30df0d06\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [695, 1495, 1468, 1517],\n  \"window\": [28025, 66424],\n  \"confidence\": 0.89,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_24\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_27\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_31\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_32\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_29\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_12\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_20\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_28\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_15\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_17\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_21\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_23\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"}\n  ],\n  \"narrative\": \"695's sole outgoing event (695->1468, t~32.6k-32.8k) is never relayed: 1468 emits nothing in the following 600 units, and 695 never transmits again. The only in-edge to 1495 (1517->1495) occurs ~28k units later and is fed by a disjoint upstream component (1474/1514/1134/1877/1909). No 600-unit-gap time-respecting path from 695 to 1495 exists; high global volume and both nodes' individual activity are the only apparent 'connection'.\"\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 93956, "total_output_tokens": 10725, "total_tokens": 104681, "total_latency_ms": 156324, "llm_calls": 12, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}